{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/discord_banner.gif?t=1749804369\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The deeper you go into the <strong>Haunted Swamp</strong>, the more you feel Witch Maeve\u2019s influence. <strong>She has bent the creatures here to her will</strong>, turning them into <strong>cursed abominations</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>If you want to break free, you\u2019ll have to defeat her first...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beat the Witch, Survive the Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/gif_boss.gif?t=1749804369\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Umigame</i>, you are a battle-hardened sea turtle on a perilous mission\u2014<strong>defeat the witch Maeve</strong> and free the Haunted Swamp from her curse. Fight through relentless enemies, adapt to ever-changing challenges, and grow stronger with every run in this fast-paced roguelite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Power of the Omnicore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/8.gif?t=1749804369\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is falling apart, but the <strong>Omnicore</strong> may be the key to saving it. This mysterious artifact fuels your abilities, letting you <strong>awaken the power of nature</strong>\u2014causing mushrooms, totems, and creatures to rise up and protect the egg when placed on them. Its power is unstable\u2014how you harness it will define your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep, Replayable Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6.gif?t=1749804369\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Omnicore &amp; Turrets :\u00a0</strong>Deploy and modify nature\u2019s guardians to shift the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Unique Playable Characters :\u00a0</strong>Each with their own weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Skills &amp; Items :\u00a0</strong>Stack absurd builds, experiment with upgrades, and break the game in the best way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>\u00a0: Every run brings new enemies, challenges, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Online Co-op</strong>\u00a0: Team up with a friend and fight through the chaos together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help Shape the Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/7.gif?t=1749804369\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Discord</strong>\u00a0Share feedback, get updates, and be part of the development. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Found a bug?</strong>\u00a0Press <strong>F8 in game</strong> to report issues and help improve the experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/Line_Separator_2.png?t=1749804369\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2985450?t=1749804369","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/2ba39f3407ca7e17135695e30d21e6864cbf7e35/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749804369","capsule_image